# Defaults for nektos/act. Picked up automatically when running act from the
# repo root. See docs/deploying.md.

# Secrets come from .env, as does act's default --env-file. One gitignored file
# holds both the app's OHDP_* config and the deploy secrets.
--secret-file .env

# The default act image is tiny and lacks node/python/docker, which every one of
# these workflows needs.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest

# Apple Silicon: most actions publish amd64 only. Drop this line on x86_64, or
# if you want native arm64 speed and hit no missing-image errors.
--container-architecture linux/amd64

# Keep the step summaries act writes; they are where the terraform plan lands.
--artifact-server-path /tmp/act-artifacts
